                                "sense_id": "486b1ae3-2bd7-3c10-8e18-d23b6c0c4bbc",
                                "text": "It is better to make a sale a little under this limit, to allow for a possible excess cutting. Where through poor estimating there is an overcut, the excess should be charged to the original sale in Class B as in Class C sales."
                            },
                            {
