                                "sense_id": "486b1ae3-2bd7-3c10-8e18-d23b6c0c4bbc",
                                "text": "Such an overcut would be serious since French forests have not recovered from the last war."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a06c4f8b-bd91-4d8d-b4bb-c27bc1eb4f6f",
                                "sense_id": "486b1ae3-2bd7-3c10-8e18-d23b6c0c4bbc",
                                "text": "Such an overcut would be serious since French forests have not recovered from the last war."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "385a2407-5d12-41a9-a35d-32c0c1c82dce",
                                "sense_id": "486b1ae3-2bd7-3c10-8e18-d23b6c0c4bbc",
                                "text": "The evidence which residents offered for the existence of an overcut included the following: (1) forestry documents themselves, stating that overcuts were done and warning of a coming shortfall in sawlogs; (2) oral reports from foresters at public meetings; (3) oral reports from loggers and other forest workers; (4) direct observation of cutovers, logging, and logging trucks; and (5) direct observation of sawmill activity and biomass collection. Residents attributed the alleged overcut to several factors."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "05297e4b-5840-4914-847d-65ca37207cf0",
                                "sense_id": "486b1ae3-2bd7-3c10-8e18-d23b6c0c4bbc",
                                "text": "(i) Bottle gourd shall be (f) clean, free of any visible foreign matter; (g) free from bruising or extensive healed overcuts;"
